+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+// The window Advanced of the Multiplayer page of Options (CMultiplayerAdvancedDialog of GameUI): the cvars of user.scr
+// of the game in a list, OK and Cancel. Measured on a screenshot of the Steam version at 1920x1080: the window 472 x 376,
+// the list at (16, 56) 442 x 274, the buttons 72 x 24 at y 338, Cancel 13 pixels from the right edge, OK 8 left of it.
+// The rows show the values of the cvars; OK sets them and writes user.scr
+class CSteamMultiplayerAdvanced : public CSteamScriptFrame
+{
+public:
+	typedef CSteamScriptFrame BaseClass;
+
